{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"qdb_j43_v9b","canonical_person_id":"qdb_j43_v9b","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["qdb_j43_v9b"],"persons":[{"id":"3tt_4ey_uti_A","label":"袁齊媯","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"齊媯","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-011-yuanqigui:p001:m0006","c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0006"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-yuanqigui","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-yuanqigui-ws2288359","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-yuanqigui:p001","quote":"齊媯","mention_id":"c-nanshi-011-yuanqigui:p001:m0006"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui","source_id":"s-songshu-041-yuanqigui-ws2634831","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001","quote":"齊媯","mention_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0006"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"袁湛庶女，宋文帝皇后，劭、東陽獻公主英娥之母。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3tt_4ey_uti","source_assertion_id":"a-songshu-041-yuanqigui-father","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"傳文明記為袁湛之庶女。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui","source_id":"s-songshu-041-yuanqigui-ws2634831","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001","quote":"文帝袁皇后諱齊媯，陳郡陽夏人，左光祿大夫敬公湛之庶女也。母本卑賤，后年五六歲，方見舉。後適太祖，初拜宜都王妃。生子劭、東陽獻公主英娥。上待后恩禮甚篤，袁氏貧薄，后每就上求錢帛以贍與之，上性節儉，所得不過三五萬、三五十匹。後潘淑妃有寵，愛傾後宮，咸言所求無不得，后聞之，欲知信否，乃因潘求三十萬錢與家，以觀上意，信宿便得。因此恚恨甚深，稱疾不復見上。上每入，必他處回避。上數掩伺之，不能得。始興王濬諸庶子問訊，后未嘗視也。后遂憤恚成疾。元嘉十七年，疾篤，上執手流涕問所欲言，后視上良久，乃引被覆面。崩于顯陽殿，時年三十六。上甚相悼痛，詔前永嘉太守顏延之為哀策，文甚麗。其辭曰：","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0006","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p001:m0022"}]}},{"id":"qdb_j43_v9b","label":"王夫人（袁齊媯生母）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"wo