位闕正，攝饋閨庭，儀被芳闈，聞宣戚里。永言感遠，思追榮秩，宜式傍鴻則，敬登徽序。」乃追贈豫章郡新淦縣平樂鄉君。后之所生母也。又詔：「趙、蕭、臧光祿、袁敬公、平樂鄉君墓，先未給塋戶。加世數已遠，胤嗣衰陵。外戚尊屬，不宜使墳塋蕪穢。可各給蠻戶三，以供灑掃。」","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p011:u0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"博平","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"追贈詔所引漢魏故實，人物和所指封邑另待逐篇核。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p011:u0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"嘉憲","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"追贈詔所引漢魏故實，人物和所指封邑另待逐篇核。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p011:m0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","person_id":"qdb_j43_v9b","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祭墓稱號或姓氏與本傳、后妃本傳互證。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p011:m0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"趙","person_id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祭墓稱號或姓氏與本傳、后妃本傳互證。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p011:m0130","start":130,"end":131,"surface":"蕭","person_id":"ph1_ms8_hyq_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祭墓稱號或姓氏與本傳、后妃本傳互證。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-yuanqigui:p011:m0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"臧","person_id":"0zd_9uz_t7m_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祭墓稱號或姓氏與本傳、后妃本傳互證。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2634831,"first_line":213,"last_line":213,"raw_start":5958,"raw_end":6231,"raw_character_offsets":[5963,5964,5965,5966,5969,5970,5971,5972,5973,5974,5975,5976,5977,5978,5979,5980,5981,5982,5983,5984,5985,5986,5987,5988,5989,5990,5991,5992,5993,5994,5995,5996,5997,5998,5999,6000,6001,6002,6003,6004,6005,6006,6007,6008,6009,6010,6011,6012,6013,6014,6015,6016,6017,6018,6019,6020,6021,6022,6023,6024,6025,6026,6027,6028,6029,6030,6031,6032,6033,6034,6035,6036,6037,6038,6039,6040,6041,6042,6043,6044,6045,6046,6047,6048,6049,6050,6051,6052,6053,6054,6055,6056,6057,6058,6059,6060,6061,6062,60